        "subject": "LU-9653 utils: fix up changelog kernel-doc",
        "message": "LU-9653 utils: fix up changelog kernel-doc\n\nGive every documented function in liblustreapi_chlg.c a \"Return:\"\nsection, since kernel-doc only recognises the keyword with a colon,\nand convert the leftover doxygen and plain comments on\nllapi_changelog_recv(), _fini() and _free().  Use %-errno or the\nactual %-EINVAL rather than the non-symbol %negative, and realign the\n@mask continuation lines under their new prefix.\nchangelog_parse_username() has no failure path, so document that it\nalways returns 0.  DEFAULT_RECORD_FMT moves above the new block\nbecause kernel-doc binds it to the next prototype.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 9c53ded1a70b (\"LU-9653 utils: Add kernel doc style for utils (20)\")\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Ib76bedaa810aadcf00109945395a5def84949f53\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68235\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Anjus George <georgea@ornl.gov>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\n"
      },
